      "relation": "甄远航的私人律师，十几年的老交情，替他处理产权与遗嘱，这趟是应邀上岛办文件。",
      "publicInfo": "何必，四十九岁，执业律师，甄远航的私人法律顾问，应邀上岛办理文件。",
      "portrait": "cinematic film still portrait of a 49-year-old Chinese man, contemporary lawyer, thin gold-rimmed glasses, neatly combed short hair with grey at the temples, dark grey wool suit jacket with a white shirt and no tie, a fountain pen in his breast pocket, composed courteous expression, moody teal-and-amber color grading, 35mm film grain, half-length shot",
